      <Description>DQ feedback loop (TDQM analyse + improve). Runs after 04_dq_validation: scores the latest run per entity and DQ dimension into audit.DQRunScore, and writes the files owners act on to 02_SampleData/_runtime/dq_reports - one open-issues report per owner (dq_open_issues_[OwnerCode].csv), a root-cause summary and the run scorecard. Never gates data.</Description>
